note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note moe_ids32 at wide capacity: router u32 little-endian picks to logical ulong words.
note 1280 entries = 128 tokens * 10 routed picks. n counts active entries, not tokens.
note No masking or expert validation here; moe_plan_wide validates ids.
fn moe_ids32_wide src view uchar 5120 n ulong ids edit ulong 1280 to ulong
if gt n 1280
ret 1
end
for i ulong n
v = ulong 0
for b ulong 4
v = or v shl ulong get src add mul i 4 b mul b 8
end
put ids i v
end
ret 0
end
